## Core information architecture

Each user has a route-shaped identity:

```text
/@username
/@username/about
/@username/guestbook
/@username/art
/@username/devlog
/@username/links
```

A profile must be made of configurable modules, not user-authored arbitrary page markup.

Example profile schema:

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "profile_voidarcade",
  "handle": "voidarcade",
  "displayName": "Void Arcade",
  "status": "Building strange little games.",
  "pronouns": "",
  "createdAt": "2026-08-19T00:00:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T00:00:00.000Z",
  "theme": {
